      "source_xml_line": 3202,
      "string_id": "lisiy_grigor_dialog_phrase_3",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Did Grigorovich give you the information about his meeting with the bandits?",
      "JA_current": "グリゴロヴィチから、バンディットとの密会についての情報は届いたか？",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "lisiy_grigor_dialog",
          "phrase_id": "2",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_bar.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_bar:lisiy_grigor_dialog_phrase_4#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_bar",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_bar.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 3205,
      "string_id": "lisiy_grigor_dialog_phrase_4",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "I found a tablet with maps and some incomprehensible records. Nobody wants to buy it. Tell me what to do with it. I don't want to throw it away, it might mean something important.",
      "JA_current": "地図と謎の記録が入ったタブレットを拾ったんだ。誰も買い取ってくれなくてな。どう扱ったものか知恵を貸してくれ。何か重要なデータかもしれないし、捨てるには惜しいんだ。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "lisiy_grigor_dialog",
          "phrase_id": "3",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_bar.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_bar:lisiy_grigor_dialog_phrase_5#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_bar",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_bar.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 3208,
      "string_id": "lisiy_grigor_dialog_phrase_5",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Yeah, sure. Thank you, man, for helping my friend out. I would have rewarded you with some good loot, but unfortunately just yesterday I lost it in a struggle and now I'm sitting here without a spear... ",
      "JA_current": "ああ、届いたよ。友人を助け出してくれて本当に感謝している。いい獲物でも握らせてやりたいところだが、生憎と昨日ギャンブルですっからかんにスっちまってな、今は一文無しでここにへたり込んでる始末さ……",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "lisiy_grigor_dialog",
          "phrase_id": "4",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_bar.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_bar:lisiy_grigor_dialog_phrase_8#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_bar",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_bar.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 3217,
      "string_id": "lisiy_grigor_dialog_phrase_8",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Let me see... Listen, where did you find it?",
      "JA_current": "どれ、見せてみろ……おい、これをどこで見つけた？",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "lisiy_grigor_dialog",
          "phrase_id": "7",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_bar.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_bar:lisiy_grigor_dialog_phrase_6#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_bar",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_bar.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 3211,
      "string_id": "lisiy_grigor_dialog_phrase_6",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Sad.",
      "JA_current": "そいつは災難だったな。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "lisiy_grigor_dialog",
